---
// Organism: Roadmap / Próximos pasos Section
// Public release roadmap showing what's coming next
---

<section class="landing-section-compact relative overflow-hidden" id="roadmap">
  <div class="landing-container">
    <div class="text-center landing-section-header">
      <div class="landing-eyebrow border border-border bg-white/5 text-text-primary mb-4">🗓️ Próximos pasos</div>
      <h2 class="landing-title font-headline font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">Construimos un rubro por vez</h2>
      <p class="landing-lead text-text-secondary font-body mx-auto mb-12">Este es el orden:</p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-4 mb-12">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 glass-panel rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-primary/20 shadow-md">
        <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/20 text-primary font-headline font-bold text-sm shrink-0">1</span>
        <div>
          <p class="font-headline font-bold text-text-primary text-base">Masajes</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-primary mt-1">Cobertura completa — turnos, agenda, recordatorios.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-primary">
        <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-headline font-bold text-sm shrink-0">2</span>
        <div>
          <p class="font-headline font-bold text-text-primary text-base">Uñas</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-primary mt-1">Gestión profesional para salones.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-primary">
        <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-primary/10 text-primary font-headline font-bold text-sm shrink-0">3</span>
        <div>
          <p class="font-headline font-bold text-text-primary text-base">Barbería</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-primary mt-1">Con walk-ins incluidos.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-primary">
        <span class="flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-bg-primary-highest text-text-secondary font-headline font-bold text-sm shrink-0">...</span>
        <div>
          <p class="font-headline font-bold text-text-primary text-base">Peluquería, Pestañas, Estética...</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-text-primary mt-1">Seguimos por demanda.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto p-6 glass-panel rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 via-tertiary/5 to-bg-bg-secondary border border-primary/30 shadow-md relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-40 h-40 bg-primary/10 blur-3xl rounded-full"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
          <i class="ri-bank-card-line text-primary text-2xl"></i>
          <span class="font-headline font-bold text-text-primary text-lg">Próximamente: cobros automatizados</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Integración con <strong class="text-text-primary">Mercado Pago</strong> para cobrar turnos directamente desde tu link de reservas. Mientras tanto, aceptamos <strong class="text-text-primary">transferencia directa</strong> como forma de pago.
        </p>
        <p class="text-text-primary/60 text-xs font-body italic">Sin apuro, pero en marcha.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
